{
  "info": {
    "name": "Taller Vehiculos - Flask + Mongo + Redis (WSL)",
    "description": "Orden = video §1 del plan: salud, lista+CRUD (Int.3), C1 Avion 15s + C4 Camion NO_CACHE (Int.1), C2 Barco 20s + invalidacion PUT (Int.2), C3 Hidroavion 40s (Int.3). Tras la corrida completa la BD vuelve al seed intacto (restaura Barco, borra PruebaCRUD e Hidroavion). TTL por len(categoria): <=5=15s, 6-10=20s, 11-20=40s, >20=0 (NO_CACHE, prioritaria).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:5000"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 GET health (todos, 0:00-1:00)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/health",
        "description": "Diagnostico en video: debe reportar mongo y redis up (redis en WSL)."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
              "pm.test(\"mongo y redis up\", function () {",
              "    var json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(json.mongo).to.eql(\"up\");",
              "    pm.expect(json.redis).to.eql(\"up\");",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01 GET lista (Int.3, 2:30-4:30)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/vehiculos",
        "description": "Int.3: lista desde Mongo (sin cache de lista). Espera 10 docs del seed."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
              "pm.test(\"lista con los 10 del seed\", function () {",
              "    var json = pm.response.json();",
              "    var arr = Array.isArray(json) ? json : json.vehiculos;",
              "    pm.expect(arr.length).to.eql(10);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 CRUD POST PruebaCRUD (Int.3)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/vehiculos",
        "description": "Int.3: crea vehiculo temporal (se borra en 05). 409 si se repite la corrida.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\"nombre\": \"PruebaCRUD\", \"categoria\": \"Aéreo\", \"peso_toneladas\": 1, \"descripcion\": \"Prueba CRUD.\"}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"201 creado (o 409 si ya existe)\", function () {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([201, 409]);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 CRUD GET PruebaCRUD (Int.3)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/vehiculos/PruebaCRUD",
        "description": "Int.3: lectura (1er GET = mongodb, Aereo 5 chars -> ttl 15)."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
              "pm.test(\"MISS mongodb ttl 15\", function () {",
              "    var json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(json.fuente).to.eql(\"mongodb\");",
              "    pm.expect(json.ttl_segundos).to.eql(15);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "04 CRUD PUT PruebaCRUD (Int.3)",
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/vehiculos/PruebaCRUD",
        "description": "Int.3: actualiza peso 1 -> 2 (ademas invalida su clave en Redis).",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\"categoria\": \"Aéreo\", \"peso_toneladas\": 2, \"descripcion\": \"Prueba CRUD.\"}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "05 CRUD DELETE PruebaCRUD (Int.3)",
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/vehiculos/PruebaCRUD",
        "description": "Int.3: elimina + invalida cache (deja el seed intacto)."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 200 (o 404 si ya se borro)\", function () {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 404]);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "06 CRUD GET PruebaCRUD tras DELETE -> 404 (Int.3)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/vehiculos/PruebaCRUD",
        "description": "Int.3: evidencia de eliminacion real en Mongo."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 404\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(404); });"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "07 GET Avion 1er -> mongodb (Int.1 C1, 4:30-5:50)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/vehiculos/Avión",
        "description": "Int.1 C1: Aereo=5 chars -> TTL 15s. 1er GET = MISS (guarda en Redis)."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
              "pm.test(\"C1 MISS mongodb ttl 15\", function () {",
              "    var json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(json.fuente).to.eql(\"mongodb\");",
              "    pm.expect(json.ttl_segundos).to.eql(15);",
              "    pm.expect(json.nombre).to.eql(\"Avión\");",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "08 GET Avion 2do -> redis (Int.1 C1)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/vehiculos/Avión",
        "description": "Int.1 C1: 2do GET inmediato = HIT. Luego esperar 15s en camara y repetir 07 (vuelve a mongodb)."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
              "pm.test(\"C1 HIT redis (TTL restante)\", function () {",
              "    var json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(json.fuente).to.eql(\"redis\");",
              "    pm.expect(json.ttl_segundos).to.be.within(1, 15);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "09 GET Camion 1er -> mongodb (Int.1 C4, 5:50-6:50)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/vehiculos/Camión",
        "description": "Int.1 C4: Terrestre (motorizado)=22 chars >20 -> NO se guarda (prioritaria)."
